# EAS uploads the whole monorepo, and without this file that archive is 1.7 GB
# of mostly regenerated content — big enough that the metadata upload fails with
# a 400 before the build ever starts. Tracked content is ~65 MB; everything
# excluded here is either reinstalled or rebuilt on the builder.
#
# Do NOT exclude whole apps/ or packages/ subtrees: pnpm needs every workspace
# package.json present for a frozen-lockfile install to resolve.

# Reinstalled by the builder
node_modules/

# History — never needed to build
.git/

# CocoaPods + native build output; `pod install` and xcodebuild regenerate these
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/build/
**/ios/DerivedData/
**/android/build/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/app/build/

# Expo / Metro caches
**/.expo/
**/.expo-shared/

# Build output from the other apps in the monorepo (nothing tracked lives here)
**/.next/
**/.turbo/
**/dist/
**/.output/
**/.wrangler/
**/.vercel/
**/coverage/

# Cross-compiled desktop daemon binaries — 20 MB, unused by a mobile build
apps/desktop-bob/resources/bin/

# Local artifacts
screenshots/
.deploy/
**/*.log
